Year = {2023},
Volume = {9},
Number = {1},
Month = {DEC 31},
Abstract = {Mega-events have always been an attractive topic for sports management
   academics. We used scientometric software packages to look at the
   studies on this topic that have been added to the Web of Science
   database in the last 68 years. Not only did we give an overview of the
   background information of the researchers, the status of their
   collaborations, and the countries and institutions they represented, but
   we also pointed out active and influential publication sources on this
   topic. We focused on the Olympic Games and other sports mega-events like
   the FIFA World Cups, as well as the environmental, tourism, economic,
   social, political, and cultural aspects of these events. We also made a
   list of the countries, organizations, and scholars who have made
   important contributions to the field. Researchers in sports management
   and sporting event hosts can both use this study as a guide for their
   own work.},
